	 219 Avenue B\, New York\, NY 10009City: New York\, NYPrice: $15.00Age Res
	triction: 21 and over with valid IDDuration: 2 hours \nAbout the Venue\nRe
	Vision Lounge and Gallery is a unique Lower East Side bar and gallery spac
	e in the East Village. The venue features eclectic décor including bathtub
	 couches\, instrument lights\, and recycled-money bar details\, creating a
	 hidden\, speakeasy-like atmosphere perfect for intimate live comedy. \nWh
	at to Expect\nArrive early to grab drinks and claim prime general-admissio
	n seats before the show begins. The Setup NYC features a rotating lineup o
	f comics with credits from Netflix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central performing i
	n an unusually close setting where every punchline lands with maximum impa
	ct. \nThe intimate format and unique venue design make this one of New Yor
	k City’s most memorable comedy experiences. Note: the venue is not wheelch
