SUMMARY:That's Not Me Comedy Tour With Concrete & Jerry Garcia LIVE at The 
	Depot
DTSTAMP:20260815T032443Z
DTSTART:20260815T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Concrete & Jerry Garcia\
	nConcrete and Jerry Garcia are two of the most exciting names in the new w
	ave of Latino comedy\, bringing their unique voices and hilarious perspect
	ives to stages across the country on the That’s Not Me Comedy Tour. Both c
	omedians have built massive followings through social media and live perfo
	rmances\, and their chemistry on stage is undeniable. \nConcrete is known 
	for his bold\, unfiltered humor and high-energy delivery that keeps audien
	ces on the edge of their seats. Jerry Garcia (the comedian) brings a sharp
	 wit and storytelling style that perfectly complements Concrete’s intensit
	y. Together\, they create a comedy experience that is greater than the sum
	 of its parts. \nThe That’s Not Me Comedy Tour has been selling out venues
	 across the country\, and Salt Lake City is one of the most anticipated st
	ops on the tour. A Post Show Meet & Greet is available for fans who want t
	o connect with the performers after the show. \nEvent Details\nDate: Satur
	day\, August 15\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM MDT \nVenue: The Depot\, 13 North 4
	00 West\, Salt Lake City\, UT 84101 \nPhone: (801) 456-2800 \nAdd-Ons: Bot
	tomless Soda upgrade and Post Show Meet & Greet available at checkout. \nA
	bout The Depot\nThe Depot is Salt Lake City’s premier live entertainment v
	enue\, located at 13 North 400 West in the heart of downtown. Housed in a 
	beautifully restored historic train depot\, the venue offers a unique blen
	d of industrial character and modern concert amenities. \nWith a capacity 
	of approximately 1\,100\, The Depot provides an intimate yet electric atmo
	sphere that’s perfect for comedy shows. The venue features a full bar\, ex
	cellent sound system\, and a spacious standing floor with elevated viewing
	 areas. Parking is available in nearby downtown garages\, and the venue is
	 accessible via TRAX light rail. \nOperated by Live Nation\, The Depot is 
	consistently ranked as one of the best mid-size venues in Salt Lake City. 
	Doors typically open 60–90 minutes before showtime. \nWhat to Expect\nThe 
	That’s Not Me Comedy Tour is a full-length comedy show featuring both Conc
	rete and Jerry Garcia performing their best material. The show is high-ene
	rgy\, culturally rich\, and packed with the kind of humor that resonates d
	eeply with Latino audiences while bringing everyone else along for the rid
	e. \nExpect hilarious stories\, bold observations\, and the kind of crowd 
	interaction that makes every live show feel like a one-of-a-kind experienc
	e. The chemistry between Concrete and Jerry Garcia is electric — they play
	 off each other in ways that elevate both of their performances. \nAn open
	ing act will kick off the evening before the main show begins. Arrive earl
	y to grab drinks and secure your spot on the floor. \nTicket Information\n
	Price Range: Starting at $77+ \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster
	 and authorized resale platforms. This show is expected to sell out — get 
	your tickets now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains af
	filiate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:
	//comedycalendar.com/event/thats-not-me-comedy-tour-concrete-jerry-garcia-
	live-at-the-depot/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thats-not-me-comedy-tour-concrete-jerr
	y-garcia-live-at-the-depot/
LOCATION:The Depot\, 13 North 400 West\, Salt Lake City\, Utah\, 84101\, Un
	ited States
