SUMMARY:Jamie Lissow: Better Off Dad Tour LIVE at The Wilbur
DTSTAMP:20260815T032443Z
DTSTART:20260816T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nJamie Lissow is one of the most relatable and genuinely funny comedia
	ns working today. Best known as a regular contributor on Fox News’ Red Eye
	 and as a writer and performer on Last Man Standing\, Jamie has built a de
	voted fanbase through his honest\, self-deprecating\, and brilliantly craf
	ted comedy about family\, fatherhood\, and everyday life. \nHis Better Off
	 Dad Tour is a love letter to the chaos\, joy\, and absurdity of being a d
	ad — the kind of comedy that resonates deeply with parents while being hil
	arious to everyone. Jamie’s live shows are warm\, funny\, and packed with 
	the kind of material that makes you feel like you’re hanging out with your
	 funniest friend. \nWhether you’re a parent or not\, Jamie Lissow at The W
	ilbur is a perfect Sunday night out filled with genuine\, heartfelt laughs
	. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM ET\nVe
	nue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nTickets from: $49\n\
	nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved and intimate 
	comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater District at 246 Tremon
	t Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\, The Wilbur offe
	rs an up-close and personal experience that is perfect for Jamie’s warm an
	d conversational performance style. \nThe venue features excellent sightli
	nes from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, historic atmosphere that m
	akes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\, The Wilbur has be
	en lovingly restored and is now one of the premier comedy destinations on 
	the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garages in the Theater Di
	strict\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange 
	Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a warm\,
	 hilarious\, and thoroughly entertaining evening of stand-up comedy as Jam
	ie Lissow brings the Better Off Dad Tour to The Wilbur. This is a solo per
	formance featuring Jamie’s signature blend of family humor\, self-deprecat
	ing stories\, and the kind of relatable comedy that resonates with audienc
	es of all backgrounds. \nSuitable for audiences 16 and older. A perfect la
	te-summer night out for fans of honest\, heartfelt\, and genuinely funny s
	tand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $49. Purchase official 
	tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOffi
	cial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jamie-lisso
	w-better-off-dad-tour-live-at-the-wilbur/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jamie-lissow-better-off-dad-tour-live-
	at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
