DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout John Mulaney\nJohn Mulan
	ey is a four-time Emmy Award-winning comedian\, writer\, and actor who has
	 become one of the most beloved stand-up performers of his generation. Kno
	wn for his impeccable timing\, storytelling brilliance\, and clean-yet-sha
	rp comedy style\, Mulaney has sold out arenas across the country and earne
	d rave reviews for his Netflix specials including New in Town\, The Comeba
	ck Kid\, Kid Gorgeous\, and Baby J. \nHis current Mister Whatever Tour has
	 been met with universal acclaim\, with audiences and critics alike callin
	g it some of his best work yet. Joining him for this special Kansas City p
	erformance are guests Mike Birbiglia and a very special guest to be announ
	ced. This is one of the most anticipated comedy events of 2026. \nEvent De
	tails\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nShow: 7:30 PM\nGuests: Mike Birbig
	lia + Very Special Guest\nVenue: Starlight Theatre\, 4600 Starlight Rd\, K
	ansas City\, MO 64132\nTicket Prices: $55 – $150 \nAbout the Venue\nThe St
	arlight Theatre is Kansas City’s iconic outdoor amphitheater\, located at 
	4600 Starlight Road in Swope Park. With a capacity of approximately 8\,000
	 guests\, Starlight is one of the premier outdoor entertainment venues in 
	the Midwest and has hosted some of the biggest names in entertainment for 
	over 70 years. \nThe open-air setting creates a magical atmosphere for sum
	mer performances — there’s nothing quite like watching a world-class comed
	ian under the stars. The venue offers reserved seating as well as lawn are
	as\, a full concessions operation\, and ample parking on-site. Arrive earl
	y to enjoy the beautiful park setting and grab food and drinks before the 
	show. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a rare opportunity to see John Mulaney per
	form at an outdoor amphitheater in Kansas City\, joined by the equally bri
	lliant Mike Birbiglia and a very special guest. Expect a full evening of w
	orld-class stand-up comedy featuring multiple performers\, making this one
	 of the most exciting comedy events of the year in Kansas City. \nThe show
	 runs approximately 2 hours. Bring a light jacket as evenings in August ca
	n be cool at the outdoor venue. Lawn chairs and blankets are welcome in th
	e lawn areas. This show is expected to sell out — secure your tickets earl
	y. \nTicket Information\nTicket Prices: $55 – $150 (plus fees)\nTickets ar
	e available through the official Starlight Theatre box office and VividSea
	ts (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affilia
	te links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://com
	edycalendar.com/event/john-mulaney-with-very-special-guest-live-at-starlig
	ht-theatre/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/john-mulaney-with-very-special-guest-l
	ive-at-starlight-theatre/
LOCATION:Starlight Theatre\, 4600 Starlight RD\, Kansas City\, MO\, 64132\,
	 USA
