DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nElliott Brothers Come
	dy Block Party LIVE at The Miracle Theater\nThe Elliott Brothers are bring
	ing Comedy Block Party back to Downtown Inglewood at the legendary Miracle
	 Theater! Hosted by the hilarious Chris Spencer\, this all-star comedy sho
	wcase promises a night of non-stop laughs in the heart of Inglewood. \nThi
	s is a hometown celebration of comedy featuring an all-star lineup curated
	 by the Elliott Brothers — don’t miss this special night! \nEvent Details\
	nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 P
	M) \nVenue: The Miracle Theater \nAddress: 226 S Market St\, Inglewood\, C
	A 90301 \nAge Requirement: Please check venue for age restrictions \nAbout
	 Chris Spencer\nChris Spencer is a veteran stand-up comedian\, actor\, and
	 writer best known for his work on The Wayans Bros.\, Def Comedy Jam\, and
	 BET’s ComicView. With decades of experience in comedy\, Spencer brings sh
	arp wit and relatable humor to every performance. \nAs host of Comedy Bloc
	k Party\, he keeps the energy high and the laughs coming all night long. \
	nWhat to Expect\n\nAn all-star comedy lineup curated by the Elliott Brothe
	rs\nHosted by the legendary Chris Spencer\nA celebration of comedy in Down
	town Inglewood\nLive stand-up performances from top comedians\nAn intimate
	\, high-energy show at The Miracle Theater\nA community event bringing com
	edy home to Inglewood\n\nVenue Information\nThe Miracle Theater is Inglewo
	od’s independent stage for music\, comedy\, film\, and community events\, 
	located at 226 S Market St in Downtown Inglewood. The venue blends a histo
	ric identity with a modern event experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets
	 start at $51. Secure your seats now before they sell out! \nOfficial Tick
	ets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affi
	liate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our link
	s at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to ch
	ange. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.
	com/event/elliott-brothers-comedy-block-party-live-at-the-miracle-theater-
	2/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/elliott-brothers-comedy-block-party-li
	ve-at-the-miracle-theater-2/
